      "id": "note",
      "kind": "note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1248,
      "w": 448,
      "h": 224,
      "label": "Notes",
      "props": {
        "text": "Run mode models the viewer-facing paths: segment fetches end at the CDN (95% edge hit; misses go to the origin shield and object storage), play-start calls read play-info through Redis, and playback events land in zone-local Kafka buffers. Uploads (about 50 videos/s) and transcoding are drawn but carry no run-mode traffic. Sized for the 2x evening peak with one zone lost: 27 playback instances, 30 collectors. Transcode workers stand for 64-vCPU machines; 750 ms is one 60-second chunk-rendition task's share of a machine."
      }
    }
